^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ direct initialization: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ base initializer: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
